# Seminary Results Management System (SRMS)

[![PHP Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/PHP-7.4%2B-blue.svg)](https://www.php.net/)
[![MySQL Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/MySQL-5.7%2B-orange.svg)](https://www.mysql.com/)
[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-green.svg)](LICENSE)

A comprehensive web-based platform designed to manage academic records, student information, course administration, results processing, and financial transactions for theological seminary institutions.

